# ── dsh-price-peak ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This directory is itself the distributable repository root.

# NOTE: lib/client.js IS committed on purpose, even though build.mjs generates it.
# A clone has to be installable as-is — dsh loads the built bundle at startup, so
# ignoring it would hand every GitHub user a plugin that fails until they discover
# the build step. The usual "generated file drifts from source" worry is covered
# instead by `node build.mjs --check`, which fails the suite when the artifact and
# src/ disagree. Run `npm run verify` before committing.

# Regenerable preview artifacts
preview-ui.html
preview-ui.png

# Scratch Chrome profile used when screenshotting the preview page
.chrome-profile/

# Noise
.DS_Store
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.tgz

# Symlink to the app's node_modules, created by `npm run probe:setup`.
# Only needed to import lib/index.js directly (its schemastery import is a peer of
# the app, not a dependency of this plugin).
/node_modules
